      "explanation": "Held: the printed page 2 explicitly states r(t)=−sin t. Solving c′+c=−sin t gives c_ss(t)=(cos t−sin t)/2=−(1/√2)sin(t−π/4), which matches no option; the printed fourth option has the opposite sign. The packet also loses the √2 amplitude factors, so a corrected input sign or corrected option is needed.",
